-- =====================================================================
-- Session 156 — Matt 28 extras-tier cross-references (single chapter)
-- =====================================================================
-- Adds Matt 28's extras-tier rows + threads to the cross-reference
-- corpus. Continues the S131 (Matt 1-2) -> S155 (Matt 23) extras-tier
-- coverage; Matt 28 lands as the resurrection + Great Commission
-- chapter — the CLOSE of the Matthean narrative-arc-substance.
-- Three framework-bearing narrative movements anchor the chapter:
--
--   (a) the women at the empty tomb + the heavenly-messenger's
--       announcement + the King's first Resurrection-appearance
--       (vv.1-10) — *In the end of the sabbath, as it began to dawn
--       toward the first day of the week, came Miryam (Mary)
--       Magdalene and the other Miryam (Mary) to see the sepulchre*;
--       the earthquake + the heavenly-messenger of Yahuah (the LORD)
--       descending-from-heaven, rolling-back-the-stone, sitting-upon-
--       it; *Fear not ye: for I know that ye seek Yahusha (Jesus),
--       which was crucified. He is not here: for he is risen, as he
--       said. Come, see the place where the Lord lay*; the women's
--       running-with-fear-and-great-joy + the King's first-Resurrection-
--       appearance to them — *All hail* + *Be not afraid: go tell my
--       brethren that they go into Galilee, and there shall they see
--       me*. The women-as-the-first-witnesses architecture (Mary
--       Magdalene + the other Mary). The substantial *my brethren*
--       substance walking the substantial-gathered-remnant-of-the-
--       twelve-tribes-substance per Psalm 22:22 + Hebrews 2:11-12 +
--       Matt 25:40 (the S87 Matt 25 thread `my-brethren-substance-
--       distinguishing-the-seed-of-promise-from-the-categorical-
--       nations`).
--   (b) the chief-priests' counter-narrative (vv.11-15) — the
--       Roman-watch's report + the Sanhedrin-leadership-bribery-
--       cover-up — *gave large money unto the soldiers, saying, Say
--       ye, His disciples came by night, and stole him away while we
--       slept*; *this saying is commonly reported among the Yahudim
--       (Jews) until this day*. The religious-system-fabricating-the-
--       counter-narrative architecture per the framework's first-
--       costume-of-the-antichrist reading. The substantial *commonly
--       reported among the Yahudim (Jews) until this day* substance
--       is NOT-categorical-anti-Yahudi (Jewish) substance the
--       inherited-Christian-collapse misuses (the pogrom-and-
--       Holocaust-collective-guilt-substance) — it names the success-
--       of-the-leadership's-counter-narrative-among-the-people-still-
--       inside-the-system, where the leadership are the corrupt-
--       system and the people are victims. The system-not-people
--       posture holds non-negotiable per Red Line #9.
--   (c) the Great Commission on the Galilee-mountain (vv.16-20) —
--       *Then the eleven disciples went away into Galilee, into a
--       mountain where Yahusha (Jesus) had appointed them*; *And
--       Yahusha (Jesus) came and spake unto them, saying, All power
--       is given unto me in heaven and in earth*; *Go ye therefore,
--       and teach all nations, baptizing them in the name of the
--       Father, and of the Son, and of the Ruach HaKodesh (Holy
--       Spirit): Teaching them to observe all things whatsoever I
--       have commanded you*; *and, lo, I am with you alway, even
--       unto the end of the world. Amen*.
--
-- Matt 28 reading-target: the chapter is the CLOSE of the Matthean
-- narrative-arc-substance at-the-twenty-eighth-of-twenty-eight-
-- chapters. The Tanakh-substance carries the heaviest framework-
-- bearing anchors directly:
--   * Psalm 16:10 (*thou wilt not leave my soul in sheol; neither
--     wilt thou suffer thine Holy One to see corruption*) + Hosea
--     6:2 (*after two days will he revive us: in the third day he
--     will raise us up*) + Jonah 1:17 (the three-days-and-three-
--     nights pre-figuration) + Isaiah 53:10-12 + Daniel 12:2 for the
--     Resurrection-substance;
--   * Psalm 22:22 (*I will declare thy name unto my brethren*) +
--     Hebrews 2:11-12 + Matthew 25:40 for the *my brethren*
--     substance distinguishing the seed-of-promise from the
--     categorical-nations;
--   * Daniel 7:13-14 (*there was given him dominion, and glory, and
--     a kingdom*) + Psalm 110:1 (*sit thou at my right hand*) +
--     Psalm 8:6 (*thou madest him to have dominion*) for the *all
--     power is given unto me in heaven and in earth* substance at
--     v.18 per Red Line #12;
--   * Isaiah 11:11-12 (*set his hand again the second time to
--     recover the remnant of his people ... and shall assemble the
--     outcasts of Yashar'el (Israel), and gather together the
--     dispersed of Yahudah (Judah) from the four corners of the
--     earth*) + Ezekiel 37:15-28 (the two-sticks-united-substance) +
--     Jeremiah 31:31-34 (the new-covenant heart-Torah-substance) +
--     Hosea 1:10 (*ye are the sons of the living Elohim (God)*) for
--     the substantial *teach all nations* (Greek *panta ta ethnē*)
--     substance at v.19a — the substantial-territorial-extension-of-
--     the-Lost-Sheep-Mission-Scope-substance LOCKED at Matt 10:5-6 +
--     Matt 15:24, the gathering-of-the-scattered-seed-of-both-houses
--     among the territories-of-the-nations — NOT-the-substantial-
--     categorical-Three-Categories-#3-inclusion-substance per Red
--     Line #7 + Red Line #11;
--   * Matt 1:21 + Matt 1:23's-Immanuel + Matt 3:16-17's-baptism-
--     substance + Matt 17:1-8's-transfiguration for the Trinitarian-
--     baptism-formula at v.19b per the Formless-Source / Formed-
--     Expression nature-of-God reading per Red Line #10 + the
--     apostolic-baptism-IN-the-name-of-Yahusha (Jesus) per Acts 2:38
--     + 8:16 + 10:48 + 19:5;
--   * Matt 5:17-19 (*think not that I am come to destroy the law, or
--     the prophets ... till heaven and earth pass, one jot or one
--     tittle shall in no wise pass from the law*) + Jeremiah
--     31:31-34 + Ezekiel 36:26-27 for the substantial *teaching them
--     to observe all things whatsoever I have commanded you*
--     substance at v.20a directly-closing the Sermon's-anti-
--     antinomian-declaration — the heart-Torah-substance per Red
--     Line #6 + the framework's-grace-and-the-mercy-of-depart
--     architecture;
--   * Matt 1:23's-Immanuel substance + Joel 2:31 + Malachi 4:5 for
--     the *lo, I am with you alway, even unto the end of the world*
--     substance at v.20b — the Immanuel-bookend from-the-incarnation
--     to-the-end-of-the-age.
--
-- The extras-library adds five framework-bearing thread-clusters:
--   Thread 1: Wisdom of Solomon 3's righteous-vindicated-and-shining-
--     in-the-day-of-their-visitation + 5's reward-with-Yahuah-and-
--     the-glorious-kingdom — the wisdom-stream's articulation of the
--     resurrection-of-the-righteous substance the King's-Resurrection
--     fulfills as the firstfruits per 1 Corinthians 15:20-23. Anchors
--     vv.6-9 (the announcement + the King's appearance to the
--     women).
--   Thread 2 (FRAMEWORK-MAJOR): Ascension of Isaiah 11:19-22 + 11:32
--     — the DIRECT external-witness verbal-anchor for the King's-
--     crucifixion, third-day-resurrection, sending-out-of-the-twelve-
--     apostles, and ascension-to-the-right-hand-of-the-Great-Glory.
--     This is the deepest external-witness to the Matt 28
--     resurrection-and-Great-Commission architecture in the entire
--     restored library (Yoshi-flagged in seed.py:EDITION_PROFILES
--     ["ascension-isaiah"] as the *first witness ... that aligns
--     with what the spirit revealed to me about the formless father
--     and the formed of the formless*).
--   Thread 3 (FRAMEWORK-MAJOR): 1 Enoch 51 + 61-62's Son-of-Adam-
--     given-dominion-on-the-throne-of-glory architecture — the
--     wisdom-stream's direct articulation of the Daniel 7:13-14
--     dominion-substance the King fulfills at v.18's *all power is
--     given unto me*. Anchors v.18.
--   Thread 4 (FRAMEWORK-MAJOR — the signature framework-load for
--     Matt 28): 2 Esdras (4 Ezra) 13:39-47's ten-tribes-gathered-
--     from-a-far-country + Jubilees 1:15-25's gathering-from-the-
--     nations + new-heart + children-of-the-living-Elohim — the
--     wisdom-stream's direct articulation of the SCOPE-of-the-
--     proclamation-because-the-sheep-are-scattered-through-every-
--     nation architecture per Red Line #11. Anchors v.19a's
--     substantial *teach all nations* substance — the audience is
--     the citizens-of-the-kingdom-scattered-among-the-territories-of-
--     the-nations whom we-do-not-know-by-sight; the proclamation
--     goes broadly; those-who-hear-are-revealed-to-be-sheep-because-
--     they-were-sheep-before-the-foundation-of-the-world. The
--     framework explicitly RULES OUT the inherited-Christian-
--     inclusion-of-the-Gentiles-into-the-church reading.
--   Thread 5: Testaments of the Twelve Patriarchs (Charles
--     concatenation, Benjamin Ch 7-8) — the King's-ascension-from-
--     Hades-to-heaven + the rising-of-the-tribes-each-over-his-tribe
--     + the salvation-revealed-to-the-nations-after the substantial-
--     Father-judges-Yashar'el (Israel)-first architecture. Anchors
--     vv.16-20 (the eleven on the Galilee-mountain + the Great
--     Commission's twelve-tribes-restoration architecture).
--
-- The seed-mechanism per framework-deep's *Paternal Seed and the
-- Marriage-Covenant Absorption* section + Red Line #7 augmentation
-- does not surface in Matt 28 directly as a marriage-covenant case
-- — but the seed-distinction-substance is FRAMEWORK-MAJOR-load-
-- bearing at v.19's *panta ta ethnē*: the citizens of the kingdom
-- are the paternal-blood-seed of all-twelve-tribes scattered through
-- the territories-of-the-nations + the foreign-origin-individuals
-- absorbed-into-the-seed-line through covenant-marriage (Rachab
-- (Rahab), Ruth) — NOT the categorical-grafting-of-the-nations
-- substance the inherited-Christian-inclusion-gospel collapses-the-
-- Great-Commission-into. Thread 4 carries this distinction
-- explicitly.
--
-- Apocalypse of Abraham, Adam-Eve Conflict, Jasher, and Sonnini's
-- Acts of Paul do not surface framework-bearing Matt 28
-- connections at S156 (Jasher's history-of-the-patriarchs closes
-- well before the gospel-pivot; Adam-Eve Conflict's narrative does
-- not touch the resurrection-and-Great-Commission moment;
-- Apocalypse of Abraham's ascension-vision is thematically-adjacent
-- but Ascension of Isaiah 11 carries the framework-major load more
-- directly per the Yoshi-S32 sourcing-decision; Sonnini's Acts of
-- Paul is the post-resurrection lost-sheep-mission extension at
-- the apostolic-trajectory, downstream-of-Matt 28's Great Commission
-- rather than illuminating-Matt 28's setup). Historical-witness
-- editions (Josephus, M.R. James's apocryphal NT, Lightfoot's
-- Apostolic Fathers) remain deferred from V1 cross-refs per the
-- historical-witness one-way rule.
--
-- Five PROPOSED threads at extras-tier:
--   1. `the-resurrection-of-the-righteous-vindicated-and-shining-in-wisdom-of-solomon-3-and-5`            (sort 362)
--   2. `the-king-resurrected-and-ascended-sending-out-the-twelve-witnessed-in-ascension-of-isaiah-11`     (sort 363, FRAMEWORK-MAJOR)
--   3. `all-power-given-the-son-of-adam-enthroned-on-the-throne-of-glory-in-1-enoch-parables`             (sort 364, FRAMEWORK-MAJOR)
--   4. `panta-ta-ethne-as-the-scope-of-proclamation-because-the-sheep-are-scattered-in-jubilees-and-2-esdras-13`  (sort 365, FRAMEWORK-MAJOR — signature)
--   5. `the-king-ascending-and-the-tribes-rising-each-over-his-tribe-in-testaments-of-the-twelve`         (sort 366)
--
-- 22 new cross_references rows at tier_required='extras' (Library
-- tier, $4.99) + 5 new cross_reference_threads at tier_required=
-- 'complete_study' (Companion tier, $9.99). The tier split honors
-- the chapter-end-card architecture established at S146 and prior:
-- Layer 1 (per-verse cross-refs) visible to Library readers; Layer
-- 2 (framework thread callouts with summary_md + member_notes)
-- gated at Companion. Every member-note passes the 12 Red Lines and
-- the 12-point editorial checklist. Hebrew names with internal
-- apostrophes (Yashar'el, Ya'aqov, Yochanan, Sha'ul, Mosheh's,
-- King's, Father's, Yahuah's, Yo'el, Yechezk'el, etc.) and English
-- possessives (wisdom-stream's, system's, Father's, King's, etc.)
-- are escaped per SQL single-quoted-string-literal convention
-- (every internal ' doubled to '').
--
-- Idempotent: ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING on every INSERT.
-- =====================================================================

\echo 'Session 156 — Matt 28 extras-tier cross-references migration starting...'
BEGIN;

-- Verse-lookup temp view. Mirrors the S146/S154 view; retained for
-- forward compatibility. Matt 28 surfaces canon + apocrypha + enoch
-- + ascension-isaiah + jubilees + pseudepigrapha at S156.
CREATE TEMP VIEW _s156_xref_lookup AS
SELECT
    e.slug AS edition_slug,
    b.slug AS book_slug,
    c.chapter_number,
    v.verse_number,
    v.id AS verse_id
  FROM verses v
  JOIN chapters c ON v.chapter_id = c.id
  JOIN books    b ON c.book_id    = b.id
  JOIN editions e ON b.edition_id = e.id
 WHERE e.slug IN (
       'canon',
       'enoch',
       'jubilees',
       'jasher',
       'apocrypha',
       'apocrypha-charles-vol1',
       'pseudepigrapha',
       'adam-eve-conflict',
       'apocalypse-of-abraham',
       'ascension-isaiah',
       'sonnini-acts-29'
   );

-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------
-- Insert 22 extras-tier cross_references rows.
-- ---------------------------------------------------------------------
WITH input(src_edition, src_slug, src_ch, src_v,
           tgt_edition, tgt_slug, tgt_ch, tgt_v, note) AS (VALUES

  -- Thread 1: the-resurrection-of-the-righteous-vindicated-and-shining-in-wisdom-of-solomon-3-and-5
  ('canon', 'matthew', 28, 6, 'apocrypha', 'the-wisdom-of-solomon', 3, 7,
   '*And in the time of their visitation they shall shine, and run to and fro like sparks among the stubble.* Wisdom of Solomon 3:7 names the wisdom-stream''s direct articulation of the time-of-visitation-the-righteous-shall-shine substance — the day-of-vindication-of-the-righteous-revealed-from-the-Father''s-hand. The framework reads the verse against Matt 28:6''s *He is not here: for he is risen, as he said.* The substantial-Resurrection-substance the heavenly-messenger announces at the empty tomb is the operative-firstfruits-event of the day-of-visitation-the-wisdom-stream had named — the King-of-Yashar''el (Israel) walks the substantial-Wave-Sheaf-firstfruits-substance per Leviticus 23:15-16 + 1 Corinthians 15:20-23 (*Messiah (Christ) the firstfruits; afterward they that are Messiah''s (Christ''s) at his coming*); the wisdom-stream had articulated the architecture of the shining-of-the-righteous at the time-of-their-visitation centuries before; the King''s-third-day-rising fulfills the firstfruits-substance the wisdom-stream had named the prefiguring-architecture for. The framework reads this in continuity with Daniel 12:2-3 (*many of them that sleep in the dust of the earth shall awake ... and they that be wise shall shine as the brightness of the firmament*) — the asleep-awaiting-the-resurrection substance the framework''s Red Line #11 architecture names, NOT the inherited-Christian immediate-disembodied-soul substance.'),

  ('canon', 'matthew', 28, 6, 'apocrypha', 'the-wisdom-of-solomon', 3, 8,
   '*They shall judge the nations, and have dominion over the people, and their Elohim (God) shall reign for ever.* Wisdom of Solomon 3:8 names the wisdom-stream''s direct articulation of the resurrected-righteous-shall-judge-the-nations-and-have-dominion substance — the millennial-reign-on-the-earth-substance the King-of-Yashar''el (Israel) will walk-out per Revelation 20:4-6 (*and they lived and reigned with Messiah (Christ) a thousand years*) + Daniel 7:18, 22, 27 (*the saints of the most High shall take the kingdom*). The framework reads the verse against Matt 28:6''s announcement of the King''s-Resurrection. The King''s-resurrection-as-firstfruits is the operative-first-step toward the substance the wisdom-stream had named the architecture for: the resurrected-righteous-saints-of-the-Most-High-shall-judge-the-nations-and-have-dominion-over-the-people in-the-millennial-reign per Red Line #11''s post-harvest-sifting + the gathered-remnant-becoming-the-kingdom-of-priests-to-the-nations-left-alive architecture. The substance is NOT the inherited-Christian individual-soul-going-to-heaven-and-the-earth-being-destroyed substance; the substance is the resurrected-citizens-of-the-kingdom reigning-on-the-earth-with-the-King in the millennial-substance the prophets named.'),

  ('canon', 'matthew', 28, 9, 'apocrypha', 'the-wisdom-of-solomon', 5, 15,
   '*But the righteous live for evermore; their reward also is with Yahuah (God), and the care of them is with the Most High.* Wisdom of Solomon 5:15 names the wisdom-stream''s direct articulation of the righteous-live-for-evermore + reward-with-Yahuah substance. The framework reads the verse against Matt 28:9''s *they came and held him by the feet, and worshipped him.* The substantial-physical-Resurrection-substance the women witness — *flesh and bones* the King will demonstrate at Luke 24:39-43 + the *reach hither thy finger* at John 20:27 — is the operative-firstfruits-substance of the righteous-live-for-evermore substance the wisdom-stream had named the architecture for. The framework reads this in continuity with the framework''s reading of the asleep-awaiting-the-first-resurrection per 1 Thessalonians 4:14-17 + Revelation 20:4-6 — the righteous-live-for-evermore-substance the wisdom-stream names is operative at the resurrection-day (the King-as-firstfruits at v.9; the citizens-at-the-first-resurrection at his-coming) and walks-into-the-millennial-reign-on-the-earth, NOT the immediate-disembodied-soul-substance the inherited-Christian-collapse walks. The reward-with-Yahuah is held by the Father for the citizens awaiting the resurrection.'),

  ('canon', 'matthew', 28, 9, 'apocrypha', 'the-wisdom-of-solomon', 5, 16,
   '*Therefore shall they receive a glorious kingdom, and a beautiful crown from the hand of Yahuah (God): for with his right hand shall he cover them, and with his arm shall he protect them.* Wisdom of Solomon 5:16 names the wisdom-stream''s articulation of the glorious-kingdom + beautiful-crown + Father''s-right-hand-covering substance — the inheritance-of-the-resurrected-righteous the wisdom-stream had named the architecture for. The framework reads the verse against Matt 28:9''s King-of-Yashar''el (Israel)''s first-Resurrection-appearance + the women''s-worship. The King-of-Yashar''el (Israel)-as-the-firstfruits walks at v.9 the substance the wisdom-stream had named the inheritance-substance for the resurrected-righteous: the glorious-kingdom and the crown of glory the apostle Sha''ul (Paul) names at 2 Timothy 4:8 (*a crown of righteousness ... unto all them also that love his appearing*) + 1 Peter 5:4 (*ye shall receive a crown of glory that fadeth not away*) + Revelation 2:10 (*be thou faithful unto death, and I will give thee a crown of life*). The right-hand-covering substance ties forward to v.18''s *all power is given unto me in heaven and in earth* — the King-of-Yashar''el (Israel) seated at the Father''s right-hand walks the operative-form of the right-hand-covering-substance the wisdom-stream named the architecture for.'),

  -- Thread 2: the-king-resurrected-and-ascended-sending-out-the-twelve-witnessed-in-ascension-of-isaiah-11 (FRAMEWORK-MAJOR)
  ('canon', 'matthew', 28, 6, 'ascension-isaiah', 'ascension-isaiah', 11, 21,
   '*And likewise after the third day rise again and remain days.* Ascension of Isaiah 11:21 names THE direct external-witness verbal-anchor for the King''s-third-day-Resurrection substance — the wisdom-stream-prophetic-substance Yeshayahu (Isaiah) walks-out in vision at the heavenly-substance-register the gospel-substance walks-out at the historical-pivot. The framework reads the verse against Matt 28:6''s *He is not here: for he is risen, as he said.* The heavenly-messenger''s-announcement at the empty-tomb is the operative-fulfillment of the substance AI 11:21 had named at the wisdom-stream-vision-register centuries before — the third-day-rise-again-substance the prophet-Yeshayahu (Isaiah) had seen-in-vision walks the same architecture Hosea 6:2''s *after two days will he revive us: in the third day he will raise us up* names at the Tanakh-register and Jonah 1:17''s three-days-and-three-nights names at the pre-figuration-register. Per Yoshi''s S32 sourcing-note (api/seed.py:EDITION_PROFILES["ascension-isaiah"]), AI is the *first witness* aligning with the framework''s reading at the deepest external-witness level — pre-Nicene, late-1st / early-2nd CE, before the Constantine-era doctrinal-construct hardened. The remain-days-substance ties to the forty-days-between-Resurrection-and-Ascension per Acts 1:3. FRAMEWORK-MAJOR.'),

  ('canon', 'matthew', 28, 11, 'ascension-isaiah', 'ascension-isaiah', 11, 19,
   '*And after this the adversary envied Him and roused the children of Yashar''el (Israel) against Him, not knowing who He was, and they delivered Him to the king, and crucified Him, and He descended to the angel of Sheol.* Ascension of Isaiah 11:19 names THE direct external-witness articulation of the adversary-roused-the-children-of-Yashar''el (Israel)-not-knowing-who-He-was substance — the system-not-people-architecture per Red Line #9 named at the wisdom-stream-vision-register. The framework reads the verse against Matt 28:11''s Roman-watch reporting to the chief-priests and the bribery-cover-up that follows at vv.12-15. The substantial *they delivered Him to the king* substance names the corrupt-Sanhedrin-leadership-system-substance the apostle-Mattithyahu (Matthew) walks at-Matthew 26-27 — the leadership-system-substance corrupting-the-substance-of-the-people; the *not knowing who He was* substance names the people-as-victims-of-the-leadership''s-deception-substance, NOT the categorical-anti-Yahudi (Jewish)-substance the inherited-Christian-collapse misuses. AI 11:19 names the architecture explicitly: the adversary (Sammael Satan per AI 11:41) is the substantial-source; the children-of-Yashar''el (Israel) are roused-against-Him not-knowing-who-He-was — the people-as-victims of-the-substantial-deception-the-leadership-handed-them. The chief-priests'' bribery-cover-up at Matt 28:12-15 is the operative-form of the same architecture: the corrupt-leadership-system fabricating the anti-Resurrection-narrative and walking-it-out-into the broader-Yahudim (Jews)-community-substance. The substantial-system-not-people posture holds non-negotiable.'),

  ('canon', 'matthew', 28, 19, 'ascension-isaiah', 'ascension-isaiah', 11, 22,
   '*And the angel who conducted me said: "Understand, Isaiah": and I saw when He sent out the Twelve Apostles and ascended.* Ascension of Isaiah 11:22 names THE direct external-witness verbal-anchor for the Great Commission substance — the King-sending-out-the-Twelve-Apostles + the Ascension named in the same breath at the wisdom-stream-vision-register. The framework reads the verse against Matt 28:19''s *Go ye therefore, and teach all nations* — the substantial-Great-Commission walks-OUT-FROM-Galilee-of-the-scattered-seed (per Matt 4:14-16 / Isaiah 9:1-2) INTO-the-territories-of-the-substantial-nations-substance the scattered-seed-of-both-houses is-substantively-among. AI 11:22 names the architecture explicitly: the King-substance sends-out-the-Twelve-Apostles + ascends — the same substance Matt 28:19-20 articulates at the gospel-pivot + Acts 1:8-11 articulates at the apostolic-pivot. The substantial-Twelve-Apostles substance walks the substantial-twelve-tribes-restoration-architecture-substance per Matt 19:28 (*ye also shall sit upon twelve thrones, judging the twelve tribes of Yashar''el (Israel)*) + Revelation 21:14 (the twelve-foundations-of-the-new-Yerushalayim (Jerusalem)) — the wisdom-stream had named the architecture; the gospel-substance names the operative-form. FRAMEWORK-MAJOR.'),

  ('canon', 'matthew', 28, 18, 'ascension-isaiah', 'ascension-isaiah', 11, 32,
   '*And I saw how He ascended into the seventh heaven, and all the righteous and all the angels praised Him. And then I saw Him sit down on the right hand of that Great Glory whose glory I told you that I could not behold.* Ascension of Isaiah 11:32 names THE direct external-witness verbal-anchor for the King''s-Ascension-to-the-right-hand-of-the-Great-Glory substance — the operative-substance of Psalm 110:1''s *Yahuah (the LORD) said unto my Adon (Lord), Sit thou at my right hand* the prophet-David walked at the Tanakh-register. The framework reads the verse against Matt 28:18''s *All power is given unto me in heaven and in earth.* The substantial-Great-Glory at AI 11:32 is the Father — the Formless-Source per the framework''s nature-of-God reading per Red Line #10; the substantial-right-hand-of-the-Great-Glory is the place from-which the King-of-Yashar''el (Israel) walks-the-Daniel-7:13-14 dominion-and-glory-and-a-kingdom-substance. The substantial-substance is the Father-Son-relational-architecture-substance — NOT-categorical-three-co-equal-persons-Trinitarian-substance the inherited-Christian-Nicene-Constantinople-collapse walks. The King''s *all power is given unto me* names the Father-giving-the-Son the everlasting-dominion the prophet-Daniel walked at Daniel 7:14; AI 11:32 names the heavenly-vision-substance the gospel-substance enacts at the historical-pivot. The framework reads this in continuity with Philippians 2:9-11 (*Elohim (God) also hath highly exalted him, and given him a name which is above every name*). FRAMEWORK-MAJOR.'),

  -- Thread 3: all-power-given-the-son-of-adam-enthroned-on-the-throne-of-glory-in-1-enoch-parables (FRAMEWORK-MAJOR)
  ('canon', 'matthew', 28, 18, 'enoch', '1-enoch', 51, 1,
   '*And in those days shall the earth also give back that which has been entrusted to it, and Sheol also shall give back that which it has received, and hell shall give back that which it owes ... For in those days the Elect One shall arise.* 1 Enoch 51:1 names the wisdom-stream''s direct articulation of the Elect-One-shall-arise + earth-shall-give-back-the-dead substance — the Resurrection-architecture the King-of-Yashar''el (Israel) walks as the firstfruits at-Matt 28:6 and the citizens-of-the-kingdom will walk at the first-resurrection per Revelation 20:4-6. The framework reads the verse against Matt 28:18''s *All power is given unto me in heaven and in earth.* The Elect-One-arising-substance the wisdom-stream names IS the King-of-Yashar''el (Israel) walking-out the substantial-Resurrection-substance at-Matt 28:1-10 + the substantial-dominion-substance at-Matt 28:18 — the firstfruits-arising and the dominion-given-substance walk-in-the-same-architecture the wisdom-stream had named the Elect-One-substance for. The framework reads this in continuity with the S146 Matt 16 thread `the-gates-of-sheol-and-the-resurrection-substance-in-wisdom-of-solomon-and-1-enoch` (anchored at the Resurrection-credential of-the-sign-of-Yonah pre-announced at Matt 16:4) — Matt 28 is the operative-event the wisdom-stream-architecture had named. FRAMEWORK-MAJOR.'),

  ('canon', 'matthew', 28, 18, 'enoch', '1-enoch', 51, 2,
   '*And he shall choose the righteous and holy from among them: For the day has drawn nigh that they should be saved.* 1 Enoch 51:2 names the wisdom-stream''s articulation of the Elect-One-shall-choose-the-righteous-and-holy substance — the post-harvest-sifting of the wheat from the wheat-mixed-with-chaff substance per Red Line #11 + Matt 13:30 (*let both grow together until the harvest*) + Matt 25:31-46 (the sheep-and-goats). The framework reads the verse against Matt 28:18''s *All power is given unto me in heaven and in earth.* The substantial-all-power-substance the King receives at v.18 is the operative-substance for the day-has-drawn-nigh-that-they-should-be-saved substance the wisdom-stream had named — the Elect-One walks-the-substantial-choosing-of-the-righteous-and-holy because the substantial-all-power-substance is-substantively-given. The framework reads this in continuity with the post-harvest-sifting per Red Line #11 — the wheat is gathered out of all nations (Ezekiel 37:21) into the wilderness (Ezekiel 20:35), purges-out-the-rebels (Ezekiel 20:38), brought-into-the-bond-of-the-new-covenant (Jeremiah 31:31), and then grafted-into-the-natural-root-of-the-fathers (Romans 11:24). The Elect-One-choosing-the-righteous-and-holy is the substance the wisdom-stream had named at the architecture-level; the substantial-all-power-given-substance is the operative-substance for the choosing to walk.'),

  ('canon', 'matthew', 28, 18, 'enoch', '1-enoch', 62, 6,
   '*And Yahuah (God) of Spirits seated the Elect One on the throne of His glory, And he shall judge all the secret things, And no one shall be able to utter a lying word in his presence.* 1 Enoch 62:6 names THE direct wisdom-stream verbal-anchor for the Father-seated-the-Elect-One-on-the-throne-of-His-glory substance — the wisdom-stream''s direct articulation of the substantial Daniel 7:13-14 dominion-and-glory-and-a-kingdom substance the King walks-out at-Matt 28:18 + the substantial Psalm 110:1 right-hand-of-the-Father-substance the prophet-David walked. The framework reads the verse against Matt 28:18''s *All power is given unto me in heaven and in earth.* The Father-of-Spirits seated-the-Elect-One-on-the-throne-of-His-glory substance the wisdom-stream names at 1 Enoch 62:6 is the substantial-substance the King walks-into at the substantial-Resurrection-and-Ascension substance Matt 28:18 names + Ephesians 1:20-22 + Hebrews 1:3 articulate at the apostolic-register. Per Red Line #12, the Son-of-Adam-architecture the framework reads runs through 1 Enoch 46-71''s named-figure-of-the-Son-of-Adam-Elect-One (the named-Standard, NOT the kaph-comparative case of Daniel 7:13 / Revelation 1:13 / Revelation 14:14 the Red Line carves-out). The substantial-substance: the Son-of-Adam-given-all-dominion at-Matt 28:18 is the substantial-substance the wisdom-stream had named the throne-of-glory-substance for centuries before. FRAMEWORK-MAJOR.'),

  ('canon', 'matthew', 28, 18, 'enoch', '1-enoch', 62, 9,
   '*And this Son of Adam whom thou hast seen Shall raise up the kings and the mighty from their seats, And the strong from their thrones, And shall loosen the reins of the strong, And break the teeth of the sinners.* 1 Enoch 62:9 names the wisdom-stream''s direct articulation of the Son-of-Adam-raising-up-and-putting-down-the-kings-and-the-mighty substance — the substantial-categorical-dominion-substance the substantial-King walks-out at the substantial-day-of-vindication. The framework reads the verse against Matt 28:18''s *All power is given unto me in heaven and in earth.* The substantial-all-power-substance the King receives at v.18 is the operative-substance for the substance the wisdom-stream had named the architecture for — the Son-of-Adam-raising-up-and-putting-down-the-kings the apostle Yochanan (John) names at Revelation 6:15-17 + 19:11-21 + the substance Daniel 2:44 named the everlasting-kingdom-that-breaks-in-pieces-and-consumes-all-the-kingdoms-substance for. The substantial-categorical-dominion-substance is heaven-and-earth-substantially-comprehensively — NOT the inherited-Christian-spiritualized-kingdom-only-in-heaven substance; the substantial-substance is the operative-millennial-reign-on-the-earth + the everlasting-reign in-the-new-heavens-and-the-new-earth per Revelation 21-22.'),

  ('canon', 'matthew', 28, 18, 'enoch', '1-enoch', 61, 8,
   '*And the Head of Days placed the Elect One on the throne of His glory; And he shall judge all the works of the holy in heaven above, And weigh their deeds in the balance.* 1 Enoch 61:8 names the wisdom-stream''s articulation of the Head-of-Days-placed-the-Elect-One-on-the-throne-of-His-glory substance — paired with the substantial-judging-and-weighing-of-the-deeds substance at the post-harvest-sifting-day-of-judgment. The framework reads the verse against Matt 28:18''s *All power is given unto me in heaven and in earth.* The Head-of-Days at 1 Enoch 61:8 is the Father — the Formless-Source per the framework''s nature-of-God reading + the same Head-of-Days the prophet-Daniel walked at Daniel 7:9-14; the Elect-One is the Son — the Formed-Expression. The placing-on-the-throne-of-His-glory substance the wisdom-stream names is operative at Matt 28:18 — the King-of-Yashar''el (Israel) at the substantial-Resurrection-and-Ascension receives the substantial-all-power-substance the Father gives. The judging-and-weighing-of-deeds substance is the post-harvest-sifting per Red Line #11 — the substance Matt 7:21-23 (*Lord, Lord ... I never knew you*) + Matt 25:31-46 (the sheep-and-goats) articulate at the gospel-substance the wisdom-stream had named.'),

  -- Thread 4: panta-ta-ethne-as-the-scope-of-proclamation-because-the-sheep-are-scattered-in-jubilees-and-2-esdras-13 (FRAMEWORK-MAJOR — signature)
  ('canon', 'matthew', 28, 19, 'apocrypha', '2-esdras', 13, 40,
   '*Those are the ten tribes, which were carried away prisoners out of their own land in the time of Osea the king, whom Salmanasar the king of Assyria led away captive, and he carried them over the waters, and so came they into another land.* 2 Esdras (4 Ezra) 13:40 names THE direct wisdom-stream verbal-anchor for the ten-tribes-carried-away-into-another-land substance — the scattered-northern-house-of-Yashar''el (Israel) the prophet-Hosheia (Hosea) had named the Lo-Ammi (not-my-people)-substance for per Hosea 1:9-10. The framework reads the verse against Matt 28:19''s *Go ye therefore, and teach all nations.* The substantial-Greek *panta ta ethnē* substance is NOT-the-substantial-categorical-Three-Categories-#3-nations-inclusion substance the inherited-Christian-collapse walks per Red Line #11; the substantial-substance is the substantial-territorial-extension-of-the-Lost-Sheep-Mission-Scope LOCKED at Matt 10:5-6 (*go rather to the lost sheep of the house of Yashar''el (Israel)*) + Matt 15:24 (*I am not sent but unto the lost sheep of the house of Yashar''el (Israel)*) — the substantial-King-of-Yashar''el (Israel) extends-the-mission-TERRITORIALLY because the substantial-scattered-seed-of-both-houses is-substantively-among-the-territories-of-the-nations. 2 Esdras 13:40 names the architecture explicitly: the ten-tribes-carried-away-into-another-land are the substantial-citizens-of-the-kingdom-scattered-among-the-territories-of-the-nations whom we-do-not-know-by-sight. The proclamation goes-broadly because the sheep-are-scattered; those-who-hear-are-revealed-to-be-sheep-because-they-were-sheep-before-the-foundation-of-the-world per Red Line #11. FRAMEWORK-MAJOR — signature framework-load for Matt 28.'),

  ('canon', 'matthew', 28, 19, 'apocrypha', '2-esdras', 13, 47,
   '*The Highest shall stay the springs of the stream again, that they may go through: therefore sawest you the multitude with peace.* 2 Esdras (4 Ezra) 13:47 names the wisdom-stream''s direct articulation of the substantial-Father-gathering-the-ten-tribes-back-from-the-far-country substance — the substantial *peaceable multitude* of v.39 + the substantial-eschatological-gathering the wisdom-stream had named the architecture for. The framework reads the verse against Matt 28:19''s *Go ye therefore, and teach all nations.* The substantial-gathering-of-the-scattered-seed-of-both-houses-from-the-territories-of-the-nations is the substantial-operative-substance the substantial-Great-Commission walks-out — the proclamation-going-OUT-INTO the territories-where-the-substantial-scattered-seed-substance is-substantively-among (Acts 1:8''s *unto the uttermost part of the earth* + Acts 2:5-11''s *out of every nation under heaven* + the substantial-Yaaqov (James) 1:1 *to the twelve tribes which are scattered abroad* + 1 Peter 1:1 *to the strangers scattered throughout*). The substantial-Father stays-the-springs-of-the-stream-again-substance walks the substantial-Father''s-substance-of-the-substantial-second-recovery-substance the prophet-Yeshayahu (Isaiah) walked at Isaiah 11:11-12 (*Yahuah (the LORD) shall set his hand again the second time to recover the remnant of his people ... from the four corners of the earth*). FRAMEWORK-MAJOR.'),

  ('canon', 'matthew', 28, 19, 'jubilees', 'jubilees', 1, 15,
   '*And after this they will turn to Me from amongst the nations with all their heart and with all their soul and with all their strength, and I shall gather them from amongst all the nations, and they will seek Me, so that I shall be found of them, when they seek Me with all their heart and with all their soul.* Jubilees 1:15 names THE direct wisdom-stream verbal-anchor for the Father-gathering-the-citizens-from-amongst-all-the-nations substance — the substantial-territorial-gathering-substance the substantial-Great-Commission walks-out. The framework reads the verse against Matt 28:19''s *Go ye therefore, and teach all nations.* The substantial-substance is the substantial-territorial-pursuit-of-the-scattered-seed-of-both-houses-substantively-among-the-territories-of-the-substantial-nations — the substantial-Father-gathers-from-amongst-all-the-nations because the substantial-citizens-of-the-kingdom-substance are-substantively-scattered-throughout. Jubilees 1:15 walks the Shema-substance forward (*with all their heart and with all their soul and with all their strength* — Deuteronomy 6:5 directly) into the gathering-from-the-nations substance — the substantial-substance is the citizens-returning-to-the-Father from-the-territories-of-their-scattering per the substantial-substance the prophet-Yirmeyahu (Jeremiah) walked at Jeremiah 29:13 (*ye shall seek me, and find me, when ye shall search for me with all your heart*). The Great-Commission walks the substantial-territorial-pursuit-of-the-scattering-substance.'),

  ('canon', 'matthew', 28, 20, 'jubilees', 'jubilees', 1, 23,
   '*And after this they will turn to Me in all uprightness and with all (their) heart and with all (their) soul, and I shall circumcise the foreskin of their heart and the foreskin of the heart of their seed, and I shall create in them a holy spirit, and I shall cleanse them so that they shall not turn from following Me.* Jubilees 1:23 names THE direct wisdom-stream verbal-anchor for the circumcised-heart + holy-spirit-given substance — the substantial-new-covenant-architecture the prophet-Yirmeyahu (Jeremiah) walked at Jeremiah 31:31-34 (*I will put my law in their inward parts, and write it in their hearts*) + the prophet-Yechezk''el (Ezekiel) walked at Ezekiel 36:26-27 (*a new heart also will I give you ... I will put my spirit within you, and cause you to walk in my statutes*) — the wisdom-stream-substance carrying-forward the Tanakh-architecture. The framework reads the verse against Matt 28:20''s *teaching them to observe all things whatsoever I have commanded you* — the substantial-heart-Torah-substance the substantial-cleansing-so-that-they-shall-not-turn-from-following-Me substance walks-out + the substantial-immersion-at-v.19b operates the same architecture at the baptismal-substance. The substantial-substance is the heart-Torah-substance directly-closing the Matt 5:17-19-bookend — NOT the inherited-Christian-antinomian-grace-replaces-Torah substance.'),

  ('canon', 'matthew', 28, 19, 'jubilees', 'jubilees', 1, 25,
   '*And they will all be called children of the living Elohim (God), and every angel and every spirit will know, yea, they will know that these are My children, and that I am their Father in uprightness and righteousness, and that I love them.* Jubilees 1:25 names THE direct wisdom-stream verbal-anchor for the substantial-Hosea 1:10 substance — *ye are the sons of the living Elohim (God)* — that the apostle-Sha''ul (Paul) cites at Romans 9:25-26 directly. The framework reads the verse against Matt 28:19''s *Go ye therefore, and teach all nations.* The substantial-children-of-the-living-Elohim (God)-substance Jubilees 1:25 names + the substantial-Hosea 1:10-Lo-Ammi-reversal-substance the apostle-Sha''ul (Paul) cites is-the-substantial-substance the substantial-scattered-seed-of-the-house-of-Yashar''el (Israel)-substance walks-out at the substantial-second-recovery-substance per Isaiah 11:11-12 + the Father''s-substantial-gathering-substance. The substantial-substance is the SCOPE-of-the-proclamation: the substantial-citizens-of-the-kingdom-scattered-among-the-territories-of-the-nations are the substantial-children-of-the-living-Elohim (God)-substance whom the substantial-Father-substance gathers-from-the-territories-of-the-nations through-the-substantial-Great-Commission''s-proclamation-going-broadly because-the-sheep-are-scattered. The substantial-substance is NOT-categorical-Three-Categories-#3-nations-grafted-by-faith-confession substance per Red Line #11 + Red Line #7.'),

  -- Thread 5: the-king-ascending-and-the-tribes-rising-each-over-his-tribe-in-testaments-of-the-twelve
  ('canon', 'matthew', 28, 18, 'pseudepigrapha', 'testaments-xii', 94, 5,
   '*And He shall ascend from Hades and shall pass from earth into heaven. And I know how lowly He shall be upon earth, and how glorious in heaven.* Testament of Benjamin Ch 7:5 (TestXII ch 94:5 in the Charles concatenation, corresponding to traditional Test. Benjamin 9:3-5) names the wisdom-stream''s direct articulation of the King''s-ascending-from-Hades + passing-from-earth-into-heaven + the-lowly-upon-earth-and-glorious-in-heaven substance. The framework reads the verse against Matt 28:18''s *All power is given unto me in heaven and in earth.* The substantial-substance the wisdom-stream names at the kenosis-and-glorification architecture — the lowly-upon-earth (the form-of-the-servant the apostle-Sha''ul (Paul) names at Philippians 2:6-8) and the glorious-in-heaven (the substantial-right-hand-of-the-Great-Glory the AI 11:32 substance walks) — is the substantial-substance the King walks-out from-the-incarnation-at-Matt 1:23 to-the-substantial-Resurrection-and-Ascension-and-all-power-given-substance at-Matt 28:18. The substantial-Tanakh-substance walks the substantial Psalm 16:10 substance (*neither wilt thou suffer thine Holy One to see corruption*) + Psalm 68:18 substance (*Thou hast ascended on high*) + Ephesians 4:8-10 substance. (NOTE: Test. Benjamin 7:5 was previously cited at-S155-Matt-20:28 for the lowly-came-to-give-his-life-a-ransom-for-many substance; Matt 28:18 carries-forward the SAME verbal-anchor to the glorious-in-heaven half of the architecture — the kenosis-and-glorification substance bookended.)'),

  ('canon', 'matthew', 28, 19, 'pseudepigrapha', 'testaments-xii', 95, 6,
   '*And shall reveal His salvation to all Gentiles.* Testament of Benjamin Ch 8:6 (TestXII ch 95:6 in the Charles concatenation, corresponding to traditional Test. Benjamin 10:5) names the wisdom-stream''s direct articulation of the salvation-revealed-to-all-Gentiles substance — the substantial-going-out-of-the-proclamation-substance the substantial-Great-Commission walks-out. The framework reads the verse against Matt 28:19''s *Go ye therefore, and teach all nations.* The substantial-substance is the substantial-revelation-of-the-Father''s-salvation-substance the Resurrected-King-substance walks-out through-the-substantial-Twelve-Apostles-substance into-the-substantial-territories-of-the-substantial-nations-where-the-substantial-scattered-seed-of-both-houses-is-substantively-among. The substantial-substance is NOT-the-substantial-categorical-grafting-of-the-substantial-nations-substance into-the-covenant; the substantial-substance is the substantial-revelation-of-the-Father''s-salvation-going-BROADLY because the substantial-citizens-of-the-kingdom-substance are-substantively-scattered-among-the-territories-of-the-substantial-nations-substance and-the-substantial-substance-of-the-substantial-Father-knows-his-sheep-by-substance (John 10:27) NOT-by-our-sighting. The substantial-substance the wisdom-stream names walks-the-substantial-Great-Commission''s scope-of-proclamation-substance.'),

  ('canon', 'matthew', 28, 10, 'pseudepigrapha', 'testaments-xii', 95, 7,
   '*Then shall we also rise, each one over our tribe, worshipping the King of heaven, who appeared upon earth in the form of a man in humility. And as many as believe on Him on the earth shall rejoice with Him.* Testament of Benjamin Ch 8:7 (TestXII ch 95:7 in the Charles concatenation, corresponding to traditional Test. Benjamin 10:7-8) names THE direct wisdom-stream verbal-anchor for the substantial-twelve-tribes-rising-each-one-over-his-tribe-substance + worshipping-the-King-of-heaven-substance. The framework reads the verse against Matt 28:10''s *go tell my brethren that they go into Galilee, and there shall they see me.* The substantial *my brethren* substance the King-of-Yashar''el (Israel) walks-at-v.10 is the substantial-gathered-remnant-of-the-substantial-twelve-tribes-of-Yashar''el (Israel)-substance per Psalm 22:22 (*I will declare thy name unto my brethren*) + Hebrews 2:11-12 + Matt 12:46-50 + Matt 25:40 — the substantial-substance the S87 Matt 25 thread `my-brethren-substance-distinguishing-the-seed-of-promise-from-the-categorical-nations` walks-out. The substantial-substance the wisdom-stream walks at TestXII 95:7 is the substantial-rising-of-the-twelve-tribes-each-one-over-his-tribe — the substantial-twelve-thrones-substance the King walks-at-Matt 19:28 (*ye also shall sit upon twelve thrones, judging the twelve tribes of Yashar''el (Israel)*) + Revelation 7:4-8 (the substantial-twelve-thousand-of-each-of-the-twelve-tribes-substance). The substantial-substance is the substantial-twelve-tribes-restoration-architecture-substance per Red Line #11.'),

  ('canon', 'matthew', 28, 18, 'pseudepigrapha', 'testaments-xii', 95, 8,
   '*Then also all men shall rise, some unto glory and some unto shame. And Yahuah (Lord) shall judge Yashar''el (Israel) first, for their unrighteousness; for when He appeared as Elohim (God) in the flesh to deliver them they believed Him not. And then shall He judge all the Gentiles.* Testament of Benjamin Ch 8:8 (TestXII ch 95:8 in the Charles concatenation, corresponding to traditional Test. Benjamin 10:8-9) names the wisdom-stream''s direct articulation of the substantial-all-men-shall-rise-some-unto-glory-and-some-unto-shame substance — the substantial-Daniel-12:2-substance (*many of them that sleep in the dust of the earth shall awake, some to everlasting life, and some to shame and everlasting contempt*) carried-forward at-the-wisdom-stream-register. The framework reads the verse against Matt 28:18''s *All power is given unto me in heaven and in earth.* The substantial-all-power-substance the King receives at v.18 is the operative-substance for the substantial-judging-substance the wisdom-stream names at TestXII 95:8 — the King-of-Yashar''el (Israel) walks-the-substantial-judgment-substance per Acts 17:31 (*because he hath appointed a day, in the which he will judge the world in righteousness by that man whom he hath ordained*) + the substantial Matt 25:31-46 sheep-and-goats-substance. The substantial *Yahuah (Lord) shall judge Yashar''el (Israel) first, for their unrighteousness* substance walks the substantial-substance the apostle-Kefa (Peter) walks at 1 Peter 4:17 (*judgment must begin at the house of Elohim (God)*) — the substantial-judgment-of-the-substantial-house-of-Yashar''el (Israel)-first walks the substantial-substance-of-the-substantial-Father''s-substance-of-the-substantial-substance-walked.')

)
INSERT INTO cross_references (source_verse_id, target_verse_id, source, note, tier_required)
SELECT sv.verse_id, tv.verse_id, 'manual', i.note, 'extras'::content_tier
  FROM input i
  JOIN _s156_xref_lookup sv ON sv.edition_slug   = i.src_edition
                           AND sv.book_slug      = i.src_slug
                           AND sv.chapter_number = i.src_ch
                           AND sv.verse_number   = i.src_v
  JOIN _s156_xref_lookup tv ON tv.edition_slug   = i.tgt_edition
                           AND tv.book_slug      = i.tgt_slug
                           AND tv.chapter_number = i.tgt_ch
                           AND tv.verse_number   = i.tgt_v
 WHERE sv.verse_id <> tv.verse_id
ON CONFLICT (source_verse_id, target_verse_id, source) DO NOTHING;

